WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.370
Get running, get running

3
00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.460
holding our flag high in the sky

4
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:18.060
Cross this endless sea with me and search for

5
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.810
a global miracle no one

6
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.940
has yet been able to find

7
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.960
With our hearts pounding,

8
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.710
we'll just charge ahead as we please, following

9
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:35.590
the footprints of those who pursue their dreams

10
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.390
No matter how stormy the night,

11
00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.390
if we put our minds together,

12
00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.540
we'll get through it

13
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:47.860
always

14
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.590
Get running, get running

15
00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.550
holding our flag high in the sky

16
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.140
Even though there are tears

17
00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:00.580
we don't want anyone to see

18
00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.520
Keep chasing, keep chasing

19
00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.520
the compass that leads to our dreams

20
00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.230
always points straight ahead

21
00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.400
We can't stop here

22
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.490
Get running, get running,

23
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.540
head past everyone else

24
00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.120
So long as we don't run from it,

25
00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.540
we can take hold of tomorrow

26
00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.630
Keep chasing, keep chasing

27
00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.510
everything we see in the moment,

28
00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.930
we should record it all

29
00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.430
in the blank slates of our minds

30
00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:54.740
<b>Sanji vs. Jabra</b>

31
00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.380
Sanji-kun!

32
00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:00.800
Sanji...!

33
00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.420
How did you get out of that state?!

34
00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.660
A bathtub fell from the sky and broke the spell.

35
00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.020
I suppose it's because I got wet.

36
00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.240
More importantly, Nami-san...

37
00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.430
Did you fall in love with me again?!

38
00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.580
I wish the bathtub had hit you directly.

39
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.440
Nosopp!

40
00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:44.880
So now it's at the point where you're not
using any part of Sogeking in my name.

41
00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:50.400
I-I'm sorry, Sanji-kun.

42
00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.390
I...

43
00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:58.400
After all... I...

44
00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.730
All that matters is you're still alive.

45
00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:03.740
Everyone has things that they
can do and things that they can't.

46
00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.080
Sanji!

47
00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:13.040
Look outside, both of you.

48
00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.250
No way!

49
00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:38.100
The Gates of Justice are about to open.

50
00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.780
Robin!

51
00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:52.270
Once those gates are opened
and Robin-chan passes through,

52
00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:56.300
the sea beyond hosts a nest of sea kings,
which we can't cross.

53
00:03:56.300 --> 00:04:00.180
Past that, there's the great prison
and Navy Headquarters.

54
00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:04.340
Soon, Robin-chan will be taken
to a place beyond our reach.

55
00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:09.240
Oh, no. Luffy didn't make it in time?

56
00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:22.920
Dammit! I can't get through here!
Robin's waiting for me!

57
00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:27.450
Give it up. You'll never see her again.

58
00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.820
You can't go beyond these doors.

59
00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.590
Rubber Rubber...

60
00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:53.100
Gatling!

61
00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.120
That technique doesn't work on me.

62
00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.830
Now, come!

63
00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.500
I said come! We're going to the bridge!

64
00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.310
Am I gonna make it in time?

65
00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:31.300
I hope either the No. 3 or No. 4 key frees Nico Robin!

66
00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.580
Anyway, I have to stop them at any cost!

67
00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.520
It's this way!

68
00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.310
Is it this way?

69
00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.230
Chimney! Hurry up!
It's this way!

70
00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.290
This tower will get hit by cannon fire, too.

71
00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:48.820
Wait, Grandma! I've gotta mark the way so they don't get lost!

72
00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:09.340
Picking me as your opponent seems to have sealed your fate.

73
00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.920
Hey! Let us get on board!

74
00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:16.640
That's not possible! The sea train is full!

75
00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.480
Get some ships from an outlying island!

76
00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.190
You bastard! I thought you were strangely calm!

77
00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.010
So you pretended to be
tied up using your own rope?!

78
00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.490
Yeah. I was waiting for a chance.

79
00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.650
What about Big Bro Franky?
What about the Straw Hats?

80
00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:34.330
Those people are unstoppable!
They don't need us to worry about them!

81
00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:37.290
We're gonna hurry up
and escape from this island!

82
00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.740
Yeah!

83
00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:42.500
Navy

84
00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:47.290
Ten battleships have set sail for
the Judicial Island, Enies Lobby!

85
00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.550
The situation couldn't be worse.

86
00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:03.770
But even the worst situation always hides a fair chance.

87
00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.480
Sanji!

88
00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:10.120
Leave his key to me.

89
00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:16.580
Are you changing fighters? That's fine by me.

90
00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:20.560
I'll do what you can't do.

91
00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.240
And you do what I can't do!

92
00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:25.160
What?

93
00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.420
Think carefully.

94
00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:31.240
Read the situation!

95
00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:37.400
As long as we have you, we can
save Robin-chan for sure! Usopp!

96
00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:44.830
As long as I'm here... we can save Robin?

97
00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.390
Shave!

98
00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:04.540
Go!

99
00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.520
O-Okay! Usopp!

100
00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:07.760
Ow, ow! That hurts!

101
00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:11.210
Hang in there! It's better than dying here, right?!

102
00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.510
Good point.

103
00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.630
Iron Body Kenpo!

104
00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:20.640
Wolf Shot!

105
00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:40.870
Some hunter you are. You just talk big.

106
00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.540
Oh, that's right. I get it!

107
00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.000
What is it?

108
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.560
We can save her! As long as I'm here, we can save Robin! Dammit!

109
00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:57.250
"Dammit"?! You don't have
to get upset or anything!

110
00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.440
Let's hurry, Nami-kun!

111
00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:00.010
Hey, wait up!

112
00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.390
I got it! I got it!

113
00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.440
Hey, be quiet. That wolf's gonna come after us!

114
00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.570
Maybe I should kill them after all.

115
00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.010
Now you've gone and done it.

116
00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.610
Ten Finger Pistol!

117
00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:57.300
Troisième... Haché!
Third-Grade Ground Meat

118
00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.860
Iron Body!

119
00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:14.540
That doesn't work on me, you idiot!

120
00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.970
What's with his kicks?

121
00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:21.880
That technique you guys use
to make your body like iron...

122
00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:24.890
is really a pain in the ass.

123
00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.890
Tempest Kick: Lone Wolf!

124
00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:34.560
Basse Côte!
Chuck Roast

125
00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:35.940
Longe!
Loin

126
00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.360
Tendron!
Skirt steak

127
00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:40.160
Flanchet! Quasi! Queue! Cuisseau! Jarret!
Flank, Rump, Tail, Thigh, Shin

128
00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.870
Veau... Shot!
Veal Shot

129
00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:50.980
Iron Body Kenpo!

130
00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:56.890
I said your kicks don't work on me, didn't I?!

131
00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:58.510
Wolf Fang!

132
00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.090
You felt that, didn't ya?!

133
00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:08.110
That was Iron Body Kenpo: Wolf Fang Stance!

134
00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.930
I'm the only one of the Six Powers masters...

135
00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:16.780
who can move around with
Iron Body active from head to toe.

136
00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:19.110
Stop your rambling!

137
00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.070
Deuxième Haché!
Second-Grade Ground Meat

138
00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:34.840
It appears to have worked,
but it actually didn't?

139
00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.800
Well, did it or didn't it?!

140
00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.030
Well done.

141
00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:53.990
I've been waiting for a man like you.

142
00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:55.480
Hm?

143
00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:02.250
Would you save her... Save Robin?

144
00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:05.060
What?! What're you saying?

145
00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:09.830
I kept quiet about this, but... Robin is...

146
00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:15.130
actually my little sister... whom I lost track of a long time ago.

147
00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.960
What?!

148
00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.630
Is that true?!

149
00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.600
I didn't know.

150
00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:23.630
She never told us anything about that.

151
00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.600
I'm not surprised,

152
00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:27.630
but it's true.

153
00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.630
Please, save her!

154
00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.640
Okay, I got it. Just leave it to me.

155
00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:37.150
I'll take this key and save her without a doubt.

156
00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.110
You think I'd buy that crap?!

157
00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:51.450
Robin-chan is your little sister?

158
00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:55.420
You dumbass! If you're gonna lie,
try to make it more believable.

159
00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:02.980
You should have realized by now.

160
00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:07.550
No matter what tricks you play,
you can never go through these doors.

161
00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:12.630
You're wrong! I'll do whatever
it takes to go through there!

162
00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.670
It seems that we disagree.

163
00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.150
I guess there's no point in discussing it.

164
00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.080
I don't have much time, either.

165
00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.940
Rubber Rubber... Gatling!

166
00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.690
Stamp!

167
00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.880
Whip!

168
00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.820
Spear!

169
00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:51.630
Did ya feel it a little this time, wolf-kun?

170
00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:54.100
Whoa! You bastard! The key!

171
00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.890
You gave it to me!

172
00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.080
How dare you?!

173
00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.190
Iron Body!

174
00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:05.830
– See ya!
– Ahh! Hold it!

175
00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.760
I'm the one who has the trademark on foul play!

176
00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:10.500
How dare you mock me?!

177
00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:11.370
Shave!

178
00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.340
Party Table:

179
00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.520
Iron Body Kenpo!

180
00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.310
Cuisseau Shoot!
Thigh Shoot

181
00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:31.760
Brochette!
Skewer

182
00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.750
Dammit! I'm pissed!

183
00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.800
It looks like you really wanna get hurt.

184
00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.240
Iron Body Kenpo: Wolf Plantain Stance!

185
00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:52.120
Wolf Hunting LAN!

186
00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.330
Whoa! A slashing attack?!

187
00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.000
Heavy Treading Wolf!

188
00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.630
What do you think of the
power of an Iron Body punch?

189
00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:16.620
It's in a different league, huh?

190
00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:17.810
Moon Walk!

191
00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.920
Tempest Kick: Lupus Fall!

192
00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:44.860
You were naive to think that you
could steal the key from me and run.

193
00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:49.550
I'm a wolf. I'll keep after you until I make a meal of you.

194
00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:54.580
Oh? You're still alive.

195
00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:59.480
I don't intend to run.
I don't intend to be killed.

196
00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:04.560
And I don't intend to forgive.

197
00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.890
Forgive?

198
00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:10.690
Are you sympathizing with Nico Robin?

199
00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.990
A distracted mind just creates
openings during a fight.

200
00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:18.490
If you have time to pity that ill-fated woman,

201
00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.910
you should think of a way
to save your neck here.

202
00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.630
Watch your mouth.

203
00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:30.590
I'm the kind who heats up with anger.

204
00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:33.670
If you're under strain, there's no
chance you can bring me down.

205
00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.440
I'm sure my attacks have done
quite a bit of damage to you by now.

206
00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:39.450
If that wasn't enough, then...

207
00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.520
Iron Body Kenpo: Infernal Celestial Wolf!

208
00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:02.020
Go ahead and laugh while you can.

209
00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:10.550
Hm?

210
00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:17.470
I don't know what's so fun
about spinning like that, but...

211
00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:25.560
Hm? What's with him?
One of his feet is now red!

212
00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.470
Devil's foot...

213
00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:30.520
Diable Jambe!

214
00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:35.660
The heat generated from spinning
will make my kicks even faster!

215
00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:39.870
It's glowing!

216
00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.490
Ow, it burns!

217
00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:56.260
Its devastating power equals that of a devil.

218
00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:12.400
It burns! Ow, ow, ow!

219
00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:17.920
I-I'm burnt! Even my bones
feel hot! They're broken!

220
00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.440
Iron Body isn't working at all!

221
00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.870
What's with that kick?! Dammit!

222
00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.450
How stupid!

223
00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:32.880
I can't believe he'd jump into the air
when facing a Six Powers master!

224
00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.460
Diable Jambe:

225
00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:37.800
Première Haché!
First-Grade Ground Meat

226
00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:37.800
Moon Walk!

227
00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:41.440
How stupid!

228
00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.920
You're really stupid!

229
00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:45.340
You got carried away and hastily tried to finish the fight!

230
00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:46.920
I win!

231
00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:49.850
Take this!

232
00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.230
Moonlight Ten Finger Pistol!

233
00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:01.030
One of my hands got repelled.
You were close, huh?

234
00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:03.670
If you were fast enough
to get another kick in,

235
00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.990
you could've completely
stopped the Finger Pistol.

236
00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.600
Well, I couldn't help it...

237
00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:13.000
because the other kick is...
for finishing you off!

238
00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:17.200
Diable Jambe!

239
00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:19.050
What? W-Wait!

240
00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:21.010
Flambage...
Flambé

241
00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:29.380
Shot!

242
00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.140
God creates food...

243
00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:46.580
and the Devil creates spice.

244
00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:54.580
I guess I made it a little too spicy.
